{"run_id": "repeat_S2_r1_20261113T071825Z", "arm": "S2", "row_id": "G-004", "flow_bucket": "3_cross_company_comparison", "status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "To compare Maruti Suzuki and Bosch on total assets for the year ended March 31, 2025, we need to extract the total assets from both companies' consolidated balance sheets.\n\nFrom the first document (Maruti Suzuki):\n- Total assets for the year ended March 31, 2025: 1,319,718 million Rs.\n\nFrom the second document (Bosch):\n- Total assets for the year ended March 31, 2025: 202,411 million Rs.\n\nComparing the two, Maruti Suzuki reports a significantly higher total asset value than Bosch. The difference is calculated as follows:\n1,319,718 (Maruti Suzuki) - 202,411 (Bosch) = 1,117,307 million Rs.\n\nTherefore, Maruti Suzuki reports more total assets than Bosch by 1,117,307 million Rs.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"comparison\",\n  \"answer_value\": 1117307,\n  \"unit\": \"Rs. in million\",\n  \"period\": \"Year ended March 31, 2025\",\n  \"basis\": \"Consolidated results\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"document_id=8fcda929069ae77825ceb19a78d3a802dba1c674820fbc65fa97aba368de04aa\",\n    \"document_id=36c2942b23f18d425a65781f30532d107bf96feffedc3251ea9035db56b06abd\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"Maruti Suzuki's total assets are 1,319,718 million Rs., while Bosch's total assets are 202,411 million Rs., resulting in a difference of 1,117,307 million Rs.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 12339, "completion_tokens": 1280, "total_tokens": 13619}, "latency_ms": 29550, "context_pages": [["36c2942b23f18d425a65781f30532d107bf96feffedc3251ea9035db56b06abd", 407], ["8fcda929069ae77825ceb19a78d3a802dba1c674820fbc65fa97aba368de04aa", 216]], "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["088c04efe1a576dc1ad63eaabd26dde8d6a9ba2e29f427f53806f973579b76b2", "088c04efe1a576dc1ad63eaabd26dde8d6a9ba2e29f427f53806f973579b76b2", "088c04efe1a576dc1ad63eaabd26dde8d6a9ba2e29f427f53806f973579b76b2"], "rendered_prompt_hash": "088c0