{"run_id": "repeat_S2_r1_20261113T071825Z", "arm": "S2", "row_id": "G-010", "flow_bucket": "3_cross_company_comparison", "status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "To compare the total assets of Aurobindo Pharma and Dr. Reddy's Laboratories for the year ended March 31, 2025, we need to extract the relevant figures from the provided financial statements.\n\nFor Aurobindo Pharma:\n- Total assets for the year ended March 31, 2025 are reported as **497,849.7** million Indian Rupees.\n\nFor Dr. Reddy's Laboratories:\n- Total assets for the year ended March 31, 2025 are reported as **494,266** million Indian Rupees.\n\nComparing these figures:\n- Aurobindo Pharma reports total assets of **497,849.7** million Indian Rupees.\n- Dr. Reddy's Laboratories reports total assets of **494,266** million Indian Rupees.\n\nThe difference in total assets is **497,849.7 - 494,266 = 3,583.7** million Indian Rupees.\n\nThus, Aurobindo Pharma reports more total assets than Dr. Reddy's Laboratories by **3,583.7** million Indian Rupees.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numerical\",\n  \"answer_value\": 3583.7,\n  \"unit\": \"million Indian Rupees\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended March 31, 2025\",\n  \"basis\": \"consolidated results\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"document_id=e97121aee57558adf2dc27d6770bec497df8a9cb4deeb37d67186abef5484ed2 page=205\",\n    \"document_id=bdd1b13a7b77a338641ee7aa03f94f105d1bd0f1f853ea6ea0986047a918a63c page=176\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"Aurobindo Pharma reports total assets of 497,849.7 million Indian Rupees, while Dr. Reddy's Laboratories reports total assets of 494,266 million Indian Rupees for the year ended March 31, 2025. Aurobindo Pharma has more total assets by 3,583.7 million Indian Rupees.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 17160, "completion_tokens": 1560, "total_tokens": 18720}, "latency_ms": 36521, "context_pages": [["bdd1b13a7b77a338641ee7aa03f94f105d1bd0f1f853ea6ea0986047a918a63c", 176], ["e97121aee57558adf2dc27d6770bec497df