{"run_id": "repeat_S2_r1_20261113T071825Z", "arm": "S2", "row_id": "G-016", "flow_bucket": "3_cross_company_comparison", "status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "To compare HCLTech and Tech Mahindra on total expenses for the year ended 31 March 2025, we need to extract the total expense figures from both companies' consolidated financial statements.\n\nFor HCLTech, the total expenses for the year ended 31 March 2025 are listed as **96,279 crores of ₹**.\n\nFor Tech Mahindra, the total expenses for the year ended 31 March 2025 are listed as **481,991 crores of ₹**.\n\nUpon comparison, Tech Mahindra reports higher total expenses than HCLTech. The difference in total expenses is **481,991 - 96,279 = 385,712 crores of ₹**.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"comparison\",\n  \"answer_value\": 385712,\n  \"unit\": \"crore of ₹\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended 31 March 2025\",\n  \"basis\": \"consolidated results\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"document_id=9b92318dceffd61054f3d190bcfd9aa5311db94e38ae7eb72186821188295343 page=337\",\n    \"document_id=2daca49ad8951f51d570dd75f5876edf5265a93764a659097797cfc3bd5f0ef9 page=587\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"Tech Mahindra reports higher total expenses than HCLTech for the year ended 31 March 2025.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 6126, "completion_tokens": 1518, "total_tokens": 7644}, "latency_ms": 33887, "context_pages": [["2daca49ad8951f51d570dd75f5876edf5265a93764a659097797cfc3bd5f0ef9", 587], ["9b92318dceffd61054f3d190bcfd9aa5311db94e38ae7eb72186821188295343", 337]], "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["41a205aa4d612fc5870ee8fd6338ff902c17eb895e814a187c926a6e96ed051b", "41a205aa4d612fc5870ee8fd6338ff902c17eb895e814a187c926a6e96ed051b", "41a205aa4d612fc5870ee8fd6338ff902c17eb895e814a187c926a6e96ed051b"], "rendered_prompt_hash": "41a205aa4d612fc5870ee8fd6338ff902c17eb895e814a187c926a6e96ed051b", "prompt_set_hash": "abc60a7fb40cc1a4b6109b37103000abc826d9961867d71cf690233dd5da7228", "model_params_hash": "afec57e6000f36