{"run_id": "repeat_S2_r1_20261113T071825Z", "arm": "S2", "row_id": "G-040", "flow_bucket": "1_corpus_lookup_extraction", "status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "To determine the total equity for Adani Green Energy Limited for the year ended 31 March 2026, we refer to the \"Equity\" section of the standalone balance sheet provided.\n\n1. **Identify the relevant section**: The \"Equity\" section is listed under \"EQUITY AND LIABILITIES\" in the balance sheet. It includes the following components:\n   - (a) Equity Share Capital\n   - (b) Instruments entirely equity in nature\n   - (c) Other Equity\n\n2. **Extract the values**:\n   - (a) Equity Share Capital: 1,647 crore\n   - (b) Instruments entirely equity in nature: 0 crore (as per the document, it's listed as \"-\")\n   - (c) Other Equity: 13,243 crore\n\n3. **Sum the values**:\n   - Total Equity = Equity Share Capital + Instruments entirely equity in nature + Other Equity\n   - Total Equity = 1,647 + 0 + 13,243 = 14,890 crore\n\nThus, the total equity for Adani Green Energy Limited for the year ended 31 March 2026 is 14,890 crore.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 14890,\n  \"unit\": \"crore\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended 31st March, 2026\",\n  \"basis\": \"Balance Sheet\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=deed15eaf8d7b9e0fa2aa386b85a01f35511fc8b4813fe92aa4212682089473d page=179\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The total equity is calculated by summing the values of Equity Share Capital, Instruments entirely equity in nature, and Other Equity as reported in the standalone balance sheet.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7131, "completion_tokens": 1146, "total_tokens": 8277}, "latency_ms": 25925, "context_pages": [["deed15eaf8d7b9e0fa2aa386b85a01f35511fc8b4813fe92aa4212682089473d", 179]], "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["7d5eb0fd6c904751febf7debaf5105e19d60708b7fbba3b43619092179f8cd59", "7d5eb0fd6c904751febf7debaf5105e19d60708b7fbba3b43619092179f8cd59", "7d5eb0fd6c904751febf