{"run_id": "repeat_S2_r1_20261113T071825Z", "arm": "S2", "row_id": "G-041", "flow_bucket": "1_corpus_lookup_extraction", "status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "To determine the total liabilities for Adani Green Energy Limited for the year ended 31 March 2026, we refer to the \"EQUITY AND LIABILITIES\" section of the provided standalone financial statements. \n\n1. From the \"Liabilities\" section, we see that \"Total Non - Current Liabilities\" is listed as 15,527 crore.\n2. From the \"Current Liabilities\" section, we see that \"Total Current Liabilities\" is listed as 21,538 crore.\n\nTo calculate the total liabilities, we add these two figures together:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total Liabilities} = \\text{Total Non - Current Liabilities} + \\text{Total Current Liabilities} = 15,527 + 21,538 = 37,065 \\text{ crore}\n$$\n\nThus, the total liabilities as printed in the financial statements are 37,065 crore.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 37065,\n  \"unit\": \"crore\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended 31st March, 2026\",\n  \"basis\": \"financial statements\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=deed15eaf8d7b9e0fa2aa386b85a01f35511fc8b4813fe92aa4212682089473d\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"Total liabilities are calculated by summing Total Non - Current Liabilities (15,527 crore) and Total Current Liabilities (21,538 crore) as listed in the provided financial statements.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7128, "completion_tokens": 994, "total_tokens": 8122}, "latency_ms": 22354, "context_pages": [["deed15eaf8d7b9e0fa2aa386b85a01f35511fc8b4813fe92aa4212682089473d", 179]], "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["7e5e0d63d0b2189afbcbe1b902ffe7a8446c30cbdedb57340352f5d5a1efe87a", "7e5e0d63d0b2189afbcbe1b902ffe7a8446c30cbdedb57340352f5d5a1efe87a", "7e5e0d63d0b2189afbcbe1b902ffe7a8446c30cbdedb57340352f5d5a1efe87a"], "rendered_prompt_hash": "7e5e0d63d0b2189afbcbe1b902ffe7a8446c30cbdedb57340352f5d5a1efe87a", "prompt_set_hash": "abc60a7fb40cc1a4b6109b3710