{"run_id": "repeat_S2_r1_20261113T071825Z", "arm": "S2", "row_id": "G-042", "flow_bucket": "1_corpus_lookup_extraction", "status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "The total equity for Ashok Leyland as of March 31, 2024, is the sum of equity attributable to owners of the Company and the non-controlling interest. According to the provided consolidated balance sheet, the equity attributable to owners of the Company is 9,004.62 crore and the non-controlling interest is 2,809.97 crore. Adding these together gives the total equity. \n\nThe total equity is therefore 9,004.62 + 2,809.97 = 11,814.59 crore. \n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 11814.59,\n  \"unit\": \"crore\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended March 31, 2024\",\n  \"basis\": \"Consolidated Balance Sheet\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=728937384f00e28e42537dfbd9c4acebe23d3592a4a8db407e735198a720f16c page=209\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The total equity is calculated by summing the equity attributable to owners of the Company (9,004.62 crore) and the non-controlling interest (2,809.97 crore) from the consolidated balance sheet.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5604, "completion_tokens": 1039, "total_tokens": 6643}, "latency_ms": 23367, "context_pages": [["728937384f00e28e42537dfbd9c4acebe23d3592a4a8db407e735198a720f16c", 209]], "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["a32291fe22c090823cefd90af3c5726523644bbaa2c49940a78ac6552e875bd5", "a32291fe22c090823cefd90af3c5726523644bbaa2c49940a78ac6552e875bd5", "a32291fe22c090823cefd90af3c5726523644bbaa2c49940a78ac6552e875bd5"], "rendered_prompt_hash": "a32291fe22c090823cefd90af3c5726523644bbaa2c49940a78ac6552e875bd5", "prompt_set_hash": "abc60a7fb40cc1a4b6109b37103000abc826d9961867d71cf690233dd5da7228", "model_params_hash": "afec57e6000f365bfd8e1584973673ecf7e6aaaff4237f52e39695d1bfdd6277", "label": "SCORED", "samples": [{"status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "The total equity for Ashok Leyland as of March 31, 2024, is the 