{"run_id": "repeat_S2_r1_20261113T071825Z", "arm": "S2", "row_id": "G-044", "flow_bucket": "1_corpus_lookup_extraction", "status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "To determine the total equity of Aurobindo Pharma for the year ended March 31, 2024, we refer to the Balance Sheet section of the standalone financial statements.  \n\n1. The Balance Sheet lists \"Equity\" under \"II EQUITY AND LIABILITIES.\"\n2. The \"Equity\" section includes two components: \"Equity share capital\" and \"Other equity.\"\n3. From the document, \"Equity share capital\" is listed as 585.9 (in millions of Indian Rupees), and \"Other equity\" is listed as 196,642.3 (in millions of Indian Rupees).\n4. Adding these two components together gives the total equity.\n\nThe total equity is calculated as follows:  \nEquity share capital + Other equity = 585.9 + 196,642.3 = 197,228.2 (in millions of Indian Rupees).\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 197228.2,\n  \"unit\": \"million Indian Rupees\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended March 31, 2024\",\n  \"basis\": \"Balance Sheet\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=9e092bb4d317944f9b65229c7d6cd2efe8032505deb88b934aa3a34f810884e6 page=137\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The total equity is derived by summing the 'Equity share capital' and 'Other equity' as listed in the Balance Sheet section of the standalone financial statements.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7932, "completion_tokens": 1039, "total_tokens": 8971}, "latency_ms": 23399, "context_pages": [["9e092bb4d317944f9b65229c7d6cd2efe8032505deb88b934aa3a34f810884e6", 137]], "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["57c3af09b95f276a884e05ffe674c61dc858812fd4b7551dde9e8633da59d81b", "57c3af09b95f276a884e05ffe674c61dc858812fd4b7551dde9e8633da59d81b", "57c3af09b95f276a884e05ffe674c61dc858812fd4b7551dde9e8633da59d81b"], "rendered_prompt_hash": "57c3af09b95f276a884e05ffe674c61dc858812fd4b7551dde9e8633da59d81b", "prompt_set_hash": "abc60a7fb40cc1a4b6109b37103000abc826d9961867d