{"run_id": "repeat_S2_r1_20261113T071825Z", "arm": "S2", "row_id": "G-062", "flow_bucket": "1_corpus_lookup_extraction", "status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "The revenue from operations for the year ended 31st March 2026, as mentioned in the notes to the consolidated financial statements, is presented in the reconciliation of the amount of revenue recognised in the statement of profit and loss with the contracted price. According to the reconciliation, the revenue from contract with customers is reported as 12,804 crore.\n\nThus, the revenue from operations as printed in the statement for the year ended 31 March 2026 is 12,804 crore.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 12804,\n  \"unit\": \"crore\",\n  \"period\": \"year\",\n  \"basis\": \"reported\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=deed15eaf8d7b9e0fa2aa386b85a01f35511fc8b4813fe92aa4212682089473d page=295\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The reconciliation table in the notes to the consolidated financial statements explicitly states that the revenue from contract with customers for the year ended 31st March 2026 is 12,804 crore, which directly corresponds to the revenue from operations as printed in the financial statements.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8547, "completion_tokens": 787, "total_tokens": 9334}, "latency_ms": 18071, "context_pages": [["deed15eaf8d7b9e0fa2aa386b85a01f35511fc8b4813fe92aa4212682089473d", 295]], "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["3149e39fdcf8cd7c0b93f2742773286acbd07a4ae0b446010c231fbcd74bab1f", "3149e39fdcf8cd7c0b93f2742773286acbd07a4ae0b446010c231fbcd74bab1f", "3149e39fdcf8cd7c0b93f2742773286acbd07a4ae0b446010c231fbcd74bab1f"], "rendered_prompt_hash": "3149e39fdcf8cd7c0b93f2742773286acbd07a4ae0b446010c231fbcd74bab1f", "prompt_set_hash": "abc60a7fb40cc1a4b6109b37103000abc826d9961867d71cf690233dd5da7228", "model_params_hash": "afec57e6000f365bfd8e1584973673ecf7e6aaaff4237f52e39695d1bfdd6277", "label": "SCORED", "samples": [{"status": "answered",