 page=181]\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The profit before tax for FY2026 is directly stated in the document as 2116.30 crore.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1348, "total_tokens": 1584, "completion_tokens": 236, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "latency_ms": 5352}, {"status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "Step 1: Identify the profit before tax for FY2026 from the provided data. According to the document for the year ended March 31, 2026, the profit before tax is 2116.30 crore.\n\nStep 2: Identify the profit before tax for FY2024 from the provided data. According to the document for the year ended March 31, 2024, the profit before tax is 220.33 crore.\n\nStep 3: Calculate the signed change in profit before tax from FY2024 to FY2026. The signed change is calculated as 2116.30 - 220.33 = 1895.97 crore.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numerical\",\n  \"answer_value\": 2116.30,\n  \"unit\": \"crore\",\n  \"period\": \"FY2026\",\n  \"basis\": \"profit before tax\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    {\n      \"document_id\": \"a057a78cffc2ff5dfdf317cb37e90e471abc639540e4d6ba23f066fd01c48539\",\n      \"page\": 181\n    },\n    {\n      \"document_id\": \"acf17a18202f3bbc2db60b54350b2a5ce9a89fe76fa267dae7287dcc2c4d2f6a\",\n      \"page\": 173\n    }\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"Profit before tax for FY2026 is 2116.30 crore and for FY2024 is 220.33 crore. The signed change is 1895.97 crore.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1348, "total_tokens": 1784, "completion_tokens": 436, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "latency_ms": 9679}, {"status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "Step-by-step reasoning:\n\n1. From the first document, the profit before tax for FY2024 is stated as 220.33 crore.\n2. From the second document, the profit before tax for FY2026 is stated as 2116.30 crore.\n3. The signed change is calculated by subtracting the FY2024 profit before tax from the FY2026 profit before tax: 2116.30 - 220.33 = 1895.97 crore.\n\nFinal answer:\n```json\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numeric\",\n  \"answer_value\": 1895.97,\n  \"unit\": \"crore\",\n  \"period\": \"FY2026\",\n  \"basis\": \"profit before tax\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    {\"document_id\": \"acf17a18202f3bbc2db60b54350b2a5ce9a89fe76fa267dae7287dcc2c4d2f6a\", \"page\": 173},\n    {\"document_id\": \"a057a78cffc2ff5dfdf317cb37e90e471abc639540e4d6ba23f066fd01c48539\", \"page\": 181}\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The profit before tax for FY2024 is 220.33 crore, and for FY2026 is 2116.30 crore. The signed change is calculated as the difference between these two values.\"\n}\n```", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1348, "total_tokens": 1737, "completion_tokens": 389, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "latency_ms": 8656}], "majority_samples": 3, "score": {"gold_abstain": false, "pred_abstain": false, "abstain_correct": true, "false_answer": false, "false_abstention": false, "gold_answer_kind": "numeric", "pred_answer_kind": "numeric", "numeric_match": false, "entity_match": null, "citation_valid": false, "parse_ok": true}, "score_v1": {"gold_abstain": false, "pred_abstain": false, "abstain_correct": true, "false_answer": false, "false_abstention": false, "gold_answer_kind": "numeric", "pred_answer_kind": "numeric", "numeric_match": false, "entity_match": null, "citation_valid": false, "parse_ok": true}, "scorer_version": "v2_unit_norm"}
