{"run_id": "repeat_S2_r1_20261113T071825Z", "arm": "S2", "row_id": "G-076", "flow_bucket": "2_multi_period_calculation", "status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "The profit for the year in FY2024 was Rs. 12,978 million, and in FY2025 it was Rs. 14,294 million. The signed difference is Rs. 1,316 million. \n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numerical\",\n  \"answer_value\": 14294,\n  \"unit\": \"million Rupees\",\n  \"period\": \"FY2025\",\n  \"basis\": \"Profit for the year\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=e57b7fc675de5a90df876e355e2b4c92b0d6928e6e8a67020496f9fc6700cb53\", \"document_id=4d1c338c892adf88bcfa40799c3d6c77dfc4e44c640cea76e1ca7de7b7bdc6c6\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The profit for the year in FY2024 was Rs. 12,978 million, and in FY2025 it was Rs. 14,294 million. The signed difference is Rs. 1,316 million.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8013, "completion_tokens": 966, "total_tokens": 8979}, "latency_ms": 21972, "context_pages": [["4d1c338c892adf88bcfa40799c3d6c77dfc4e44c640cea76e1ca7de7b7bdc6c6", 349], ["e57b7fc675de5a90df876e355e2b4c92b0d6928e6e8a67020496f9fc6700cb53", 309]], "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["faa898a7511b39661f5c929a22585585c19e97bcf37499f4868c3465c60192f0", "faa898a7511b39661f5c929a22585585c19e97bcf37499f4868c3465c60192f0", "faa898a7511b39661f5c929a22585585c19e97bcf37499f4868c3465c60192f0"], "rendered_prompt_hash": "faa898a7511b39661f5c929a22585585c19e97bcf37499f4868c3465c60192f0", "prompt_set_hash": "abc60a7fb40cc1a4b6109b37103000abc826d9961867d71cf690233dd5da7228", "model_params_hash": "afec57e6000f365bfd8e1584973673ecf7e6aaaff4237f52e39695d1bfdd6277", "label": "SCORED", "samples": [{"status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "The profit for the year in FY2024 was Rs. 12,978 million, and in FY2025 it was Rs. 14,294 million. The signed difference is Rs. 1,316 million. \n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numerical\",\n  \"answer_value\": 14294,\n  \"unit\": \"million Rupees\",\n  \"period\": \"FY2025\",\n  \"basis\": \"Profit for the year\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=e57b7fc675de5a90df876e355e2b4c92b0d6928e6e8a67020496f9fc6700cb53\", \"document_id=4d1c338c892adf88bcfa40799c3d6c77dfc4e44c640cea76e1ca7de7b7bdc6c6\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The profit for the year in FY2024 was Rs. 12,978 million, and in FY2025 it was Rs. 14,294 million. The signed difference is Rs. 1,316 million.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2671, "total_tokens": 2980, "completion_tokens": 309, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "latency_ms": 7149}, {"status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "Profit for the year in FY2024 was Rs. 12,978 million, and in FY2025 it was Rs. 14,294 million. The signed difference is Rs. 1,316 million. \n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numeric\",\n  \"answer_value\": 14294,\n  \"unit\": \"million\",\n  \"period\": \"FY2025\",\n  \"basis\": \"consolidated\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=e57b7fc675de5a90df876e355e2b4c92b0d6928e6e8a67020496f9fc6700cb53\", \"document_id=4d1c338c892adf88bcfa40799c3d6c77dfc4e44c640cea76e1ca7de7b7bdc6c6\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The profit for the year in FY2024 is stated as Rs. 12,978 million, and in FY2025 it is stated as Rs. 14,294 million.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2671, "total_tokens": 2965, "completion_tokens": 294, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "latency_ms": 6638}, {"status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "**Step-by-step reasoning:**\n1. The \"Profit for the year\" for FY2024 is given as Rs. 12,978 million.\n2. The \"Profit for the year\" for FY2025 is given as Rs. 14,294 million.\n3. To find the signed difference, subtract the FY2024 profit from the FY2025 profit: 14,294 - 12,978 = 1,316.\n\n**Final Answer:**\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numerical\",\n  \"answer_value\": 14294,\n  \"unit\": \"million\",\n  \"period\": \"FY2025\",\n  \"basis\": \"consolidated\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=e57b7fc675de5a90df876e355e2b4c92b0d6928e6e8a67020496f9fc6700cb53\", \"document_id=4d1c338c