e the signed difference.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2188, "total_tokens": 2590, "completion_tokens": 402, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "latency_ms": 9001}, {"status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "The revenue from operations for Biocon Limited in FY2024 (March 31, 2024) is 147,557 million Indian Rupees. For FY2025 (March 31, 2025), the revenue from operations is 152,617 million Indian Rupees. The signed difference between the two figures is 5,060 million Indian Rupees. \n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numerical\",\n  \"answer_value\": 147557,\n  \"unit\": \"million\",\n  \"period\": \"FY2024\",\n  \"basis\": \"consolidated\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=e57b7fc675de5a90df876e355e2b4c92b0d6928e6e8a67020496f9fc6700cb53 page=342\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The revenue from operations for FY2024 is explicitly stated as 147,557 million Indian Rupees in the provided document.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2188, "total_tokens": 2453, "completion_tokens": 265, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "latency_ms": 5979}], "majority_samples": 3, "score": {"gold_abstain": false, "pred_abstain": false, "abstain_correct": true, "false_answer": false, "false_abstention": false, "gold_answer_kind": "numeric", "pred_answer_kind": "numeric", "numeric_match": false, "entity_match": null, "citation_valid": true, "parse_ok": true}, "score_v1": {"gold_abstain": false, "pred_abstain": false, "abstain_correct": true, "false_answer": false, "false_abstention": false, "gold_answer_kind": "numeric", "pred_answer_kind": "numeric", "numeric_match": false, "entity_match": null, "citation_valid": true, "parse_ok": true}, "scorer_version": "v2_unit_norm"}
